   "options": "<div class=\"small\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;margin-bottom:10px\"><b>Which bag type?</b> Count the pouches joined together in the bag set opened for this donor. Each pouch holds one component after the bag is spun.<table class=\"table table-bordered table-sm\" style=\"margin:6px 0\"><tr><th>Bag Type</th><th>Pouches</th><th>Can be split into</th></tr><tr><td>Single</td><td>1</td><td>Nothing. Stays Whole Blood</td></tr><tr><td>Double</td><td>2</td><td>Red Cells + FFP (or Plasma)</td></tr><tr><td>Triple</td><td>3</td><td>Red Cells + FFP + Platelets (most common)</td></tr><tr><td>Quadruple</td><td>4</td><td>Red Cells + FFP + Platelets + one more</td></tr></table>FFP and Plasma come from the same plasma: choose one. Wrong type entered? Officer: Actions &gt; Correct Bag Type (before splitting).</div>"
